1
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:38,080
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Naruto…</i></b></font>

2
00:00:41,130 --> 00:00:43,170
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Sometimes your eyes</i>
<i>are better than mine.</i></b></font>

3
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:48,920
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Sasuke is in the darkness</i>
<i>right now…</i></b></font>

4
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:52,710
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Go…</i></b></font>

5
00:00:53,130 --> 00:00:55,750
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>You're the only one</i>
<i>who can save him.</i></b></font>

6
00:00:58,210 --> 00:00:59,210
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Yeah…</b></font>

7
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:02,290
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I know.</b></font>

8
00:02:33,070 --> 00:02:38,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>The Final Battle</i>

</b></font>

9
00:03:01,030 --> 00:03:02,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>My explanation of
what it means to be Hokage</b></font>

10
00:03:03,070 --> 00:03:04,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>represents my response.</b></font>

11
00:03:05,570 --> 00:03:08,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The way Itachi lived
led me to this answer.</b></font>

12
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:13,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>To protect the Land of Fire
and the Leaf Village,</b></font>

13
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:16,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>he sacrificed both
his clan and himself.</b></font>

14
00:03:16,900 --> 00:03:18,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>First, I needed to know why.</b></font>

15
00:03:19,980 --> 00:03:23,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What is this Land and Village
that he would go so far to protect?</b></font>

16
00:03:24,570 --> 00:03:26,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The previous Hokage said…</b></font>

17
00:03:27,110 --> 00:03:30,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>…that the village is a framework</b></font>

18
00:03:30,110 --> 00:03:33,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>created to stop the slaughter
of clans and children…</b></font>

19
00:03:34,030 --> 00:03:36,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>…a framework that was
supposed to lead to peace.</b></font>

20
00:03:37,030 --> 00:03:40,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Itachi tried to sustain
that peace all by himself.</b></font>

21
00:03:41,150 --> 00:03:43,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's when I finally understood…</b></font>

22
00:03:44,070 --> 00:03:46,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Suffering bitter experiences,
living in darkness</b></font>

23
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:50,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>as a criminal and traitor
against Land and Village…</b></font>

24
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:52,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He was a shinobi
who took on all hatred</b></font>

25
00:03:52,980 --> 00:03:55,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and protected the Land of Fire and
the Leaf Village from the shadows.</b></font>

26
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:59,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I feel he was the true Hokage.</b></font>

27
00:04:03,980 --> 00:04:06,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's not the one who is
acknowledged by all…</b></font>

28
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:09,190
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>…but the one who
accepts all the hatred</b></font>

29
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>that is worthy of that title.</b></font>

30
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:15,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I eventually came to understand
Itachi's feelings</b></font>

31
00:04:15,610 --> 00:04:17,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>for his Land and Village.</b></font>

32
00:04:18,650 --> 00:04:20,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>My big brother failed
in just one aspect.</b></font>

33
00:04:20,900 --> 00:04:22,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He let me,
his little brother, live.</b></font>

34
00:04:22,900 --> 00:04:24,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Unable to hide the truth from me,</b></font>

35
00:04:25,030 --> 00:04:27,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>he allowed the hatred
to disseminate.</b></font>

36
00:04:31,030 --> 00:04:34,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>However… I'm not like
my Big Brother anymore.</b></font>

37
00:04:35,530 --> 00:04:37,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I have no father, mother, brother…</b></font>

38
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:39,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>not even a single member
of my clan.</b></font>

39
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:45,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I am all alone.</b></font>

40
00:04:47,150 --> 00:04:51,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I alone can bear the weight
of all the hatred now.</b></font>

41
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:55,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>And I alone will deal
with everything personally.</b></font>

42
00:04:55,610 --> 00:04:58,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I will handle all of
the shinobi's problems.</b></font>

43
00:04:59,150 --> 00:05:03,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I will also dispense
all judgment and punishment.</b></font>

44
00:05:04,230 --> 00:05:06,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'll concentrate
all hatred upon myself…</b></font>

45
00:05:07,320 --> 00:05:10,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>…and bring together every
single village under my control.</b></font>

46
00:05:11,320 --> 00:05:14,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hatred inside darkness
cannot be eliminated.</b></font>

47
00:05:15,530 --> 00:05:16,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>In which case, I'd rather…</b></font>

48
00:05:23,190 --> 00:05:25,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's right…
What the Hokage is to me…</b></font>

49
00:05:26,070 --> 00:05:28,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>…is someone who will sear away
the darkness of all Five Villages</b></font>

50
00:05:28,860 --> 00:05:30,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>with only his own flame.</b></font>

51
00:05:30,820 --> 00:05:33,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>And then keeps living
by eating the ashes.</b></font>

52
00:05:33,940 --> 00:05:37,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>And you think everyone will just
sit back and say "yes" to that?</b></font>

53
00:05:38,530 --> 00:05:39,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I told you already…</b></font>

54
00:05:40,280 --> 00:05:43,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I don't care what you
or anyone else thinks.</b></font>

55
00:05:44,030 --> 00:05:47,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Besides, I have the power now
to control it all.</b></font>

56
00:05:47,900 --> 00:05:51,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You don't have a clue
about how Itachi lived!</b></font>

57
00:05:52,030 --> 00:05:53,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>There are things
you can't do alone!</b></font>

58
00:05:54,610 --> 00:05:56,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Just like our battle with Kaguya!</b></font>

59
00:06:00,030 --> 00:06:01,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But things don't always go well…</b></font>

60
00:06:02,940 --> 00:06:04,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Like with these two stone statues</b></font>

61
00:06:06,070 --> 00:06:08,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>And us two brothers…</i></b></font>

62
00:06:10,820 --> 00:06:12,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>With revolution…</b></font>

63
00:06:12,780 --> 00:06:14,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>…the villages will no longer
have to bear darkness.</b></font>

64
00:06:15,230 --> 00:06:16,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>And I alone
will become the darkness.</b></font>

65
00:06:17,860 --> 00:06:21,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'll dispose of the deep darkness
of the past,</b></font>

66
00:06:21,570 --> 00:06:23,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and build a pure white future
from scratch.</b></font>

67
00:06:24,690 --> 00:06:27,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You mean by killing
the Tailed Beasts,</b></font>

68
00:06:27,190 --> 00:06:28,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and the Five Kage?!</b></font>

69
00:06:29,230 --> 00:06:30,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Exactly.</b></font>

70
00:06:31,980 --> 00:06:33,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm casting off the past.</b></font>

71
00:06:35,610 --> 00:06:40,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're saying you can pretend
nothing ever happened with Itachi?</b></font>

72
00:06:40,650 --> 00:06:43,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You and Itachi were brothers,
and a lot happened between you…</b></font>

73
00:06:44,030 --> 00:06:45,440
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's what made you
who you are today!</b></font>

74
00:06:46,440 --> 00:06:49,690
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Itachi is now in my past.</b></font>

75
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:54,690
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm cutting all past mistakes and
doubts here, and starting anew.</b></font>

76
00:06:55,530 --> 00:06:57,690
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Beginning by cutting you down.</b></font>

77
00:06:58,780 --> 00:07:01,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Yours will be
the last blood I shed,</b></font>

78
00:07:01,440 --> 00:07:03,440
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>in the memory of my late brother.</b></font>

79
00:07:08,900 --> 00:07:10,150
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I won't…let you kill me.</b></font>

80
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:15,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I learned everything I know
from the people of my past!</b></font>

81
00:07:16,110 --> 00:07:19,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Especially about how to figure out
what to do after making a mistake.</b></font>

82
00:07:21,610 --> 00:07:23,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>You said you consider</i>
<i>Sasuke a brother.</i></b></font>

83
00:07:24,530 --> 00:07:25,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>That's why, Naruto,</i></b></font>

84
00:07:26,070 --> 00:07:29,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I believe you are the only one</i>
<i>who can stop Sasuke.</i></b></font>

85
00:07:30,820 --> 00:07:32,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I'm leaving Sasuke to you.</i></b></font>

86
00:07:33,650 --> 00:07:34,690
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's why…</b></font>

87
00:07:35,980 --> 00:07:37,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I won't let you kill me.</b></font>

88
00:07:47,900 --> 00:07:48,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Lord Sage!</b></font>

89
00:07:49,780 --> 00:07:52,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It seems it's almost time.</b></font>

90
00:07:52,530 --> 00:07:53,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What…</b></font>

91
00:07:54,730 --> 00:07:56,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What should I be doing?</b></font>

92
00:07:56,900 --> 00:07:58,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Just continue to have faith.</b></font>

93
00:07:59,530 --> 00:08:02,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Right now, that is all we can do.</b></font>

94
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:19,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>What you do and what transpires,</i>
<i>will be up to the two of you.</i></b></font>

95
00:08:19,980 --> 00:08:23,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Sasuke and I aren't real brothers,</i></b></font>

96
00:08:23,400 --> 00:08:25,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>but I think we can make peace</i>
<i>with each other.</i></b></font>

97
00:08:26,070 --> 00:08:27,690
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Now that Itachi's gone,</i></b></font>

98
00:08:27,780 --> 00:08:30,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I feel like I'm finally,</i>
<i>truly alone.</i></b></font>

99
00:08:30,530 --> 00:08:32,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>But with Naruto,</i></b></font>

100
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:35,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>he's the one person</i>
<i>I have to cut down.</i></b></font>

101
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:38,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>My version of the Hokage</i>
<i>can only come to be</i></b></font>

102
00:08:38,820 --> 00:08:40,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>by severing all bonds</i>
<i>and being alone.</i></b></font>

103
00:08:41,820 --> 00:08:42,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Why?</i></b></font>

104
00:08:43,280 --> 00:08:44,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Because…</i></b></font>

105
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Because to me…</i></b></font>

106
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:48,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>…we're really good friends.</i></b></font>

107
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:51,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>…he is still my closest friend.</i></b></font>

108
00:08:57,860 --> 00:09:03,190
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Naruto… Sasuke…</i>
<i>Show me your answer…</i></b></font>

109
00:09:04,400 --> 00:09:06,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Show me the answer for all shinobi!</i></b></font>

110
00:11:17,650 --> 00:11:19,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Inferno Style: Honoikazuchi!</b></font>

111
00:11:58,070 --> 00:11:59,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>His left eye is…</i></b></font>

112
00:14:42,940 --> 00:14:45,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>How the hell do you think</i>
<i>you understand?</i></b></font>

113
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:47,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>You've been alone from the start!</i></b></font>

114
00:14:47,940 --> 00:14:49,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>It's because I have these ties,</i>
<i>that I feel this agony.</i></b></font>

115
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:52,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>How could you possibly understand</i></b></font>

116
00:14:52,610 --> 00:14:55,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>what it feels like</i>
<i>to lose all that?!</i></b></font>

117
00:15:27,610 --> 00:15:28,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What's the matter?</b></font>

118
00:15:29,110 --> 00:15:30,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Are you just going to play defense?</b></font>

119
00:16:39,110 --> 00:16:41,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>If you keep stalling, you'll die.</b></font>

120
00:16:46,110 --> 00:16:48,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I don't wanna kill you!</b></font>

121
00:16:49,900 --> 00:16:53,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>To me, you've become</i>
<i>my closest friend.</i></b></font>

122
00:16:54,980 --> 00:16:59,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're trying to be alone again
and I can't let that happen!</b></font>

123
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:03,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Especially since we both know
what that's like…</b></font>

124
00:17:04,030 --> 00:17:06,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's why I can't let you…</b></font>

125
00:17:17,030 --> 00:17:18,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>…go there…</b></font>

126
00:17:18,730 --> 00:17:20,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>…intentionally!</b></font>

127
00:17:57,070 --> 00:17:58,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Quit yapping.</b></font>

128
00:17:59,320 --> 00:18:00,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>We're both different from</b></font>

129
00:18:00,730 --> 00:18:03,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>the two boys who
fought here long ago…</b></font>

130
00:18:05,110 --> 00:18:06,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I know your heart…</b></font>

131
00:18:08,320 --> 00:18:10,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>…and you, mine…</b></font>

132
00:18:11,570 --> 00:18:13,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But you still wanna fight me?</b></font>

133
00:18:14,730 --> 00:18:16,190
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>All the more, because it's you.</b></font>

134
00:18:17,480 --> 00:18:19,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I have to cut you out of my life.</b></font>

135
00:18:20,110 --> 00:18:23,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>There's no guarantee that the world</b></font>

136
00:18:23,190 --> 00:18:25,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>you'll rebuild
after severing the past…</b></font>

137
00:18:25,650 --> 00:18:28,190
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>…won't end up just like this one,
you know.</b></font>

138
00:18:29,070 --> 00:18:32,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's exactly why I'll continue
to watch over that world…</b></font>

139
00:18:33,570 --> 00:18:35,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>So it doesn't.</b></font>

140
00:18:35,230 --> 00:18:37,190
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're missing the point!</b></font>

141
00:18:37,940 --> 00:18:40,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The Five Villages
are finally united!</b></font>

142
00:18:41,570 --> 00:18:46,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Yeah… But that's only because
they found a common enemy.</b></font>

143
00:18:47,070 --> 00:18:52,150
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>To defeat the Akatsuki, Madara,
and Kaguya…</b></font>

144
00:18:52,360 --> 00:18:54,190
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>the Five Villages had no choice
but to discard their grudges</b></font>

145
00:18:54,280 --> 00:18:56,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and form an alliance
in order to survive.</b></font>

146
00:18:58,530 --> 00:19:01,690
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But their mutual foes are now gone.</b></font>

147
00:19:01,980 --> 00:19:05,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Eventually, conflicts between
each village will begin again.</b></font>

148
00:19:05,610 --> 00:19:09,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>So this time,
you're gonna become the enemy?</b></font>

149
00:19:09,980 --> 00:19:13,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>And? What'll happen
after you're gone?</b></font>

150
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:16,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Finally,</b></font>

151
00:19:17,070 --> 00:19:19,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>all the dots have connected
and formed a straight line.</b></font>

152
00:19:20,150 --> 00:19:21,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I started with the Sharingan</b></font>

153
00:19:22,030 --> 00:19:24,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and now, I possess
the power of the Rinnegan.</b></font>

154
00:19:24,860 --> 00:19:28,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Reincarnation, immortality…
I have many options.</b></font>

155
00:19:29,440 --> 00:19:32,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'll also be able to control things
from the shadows,</b></font>

156
00:19:32,110 --> 00:19:33,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>instead of through battle.</b></font>

157
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:37,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're planning to
return to that hell,</b></font>

158
00:19:37,110 --> 00:19:40,690
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>for the rest of your life,
or rather for all eternity?</b></font>

159
00:19:40,820 --> 00:19:42,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>While being hated by all?</b></font>

160
00:19:45,030 --> 00:19:48,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>To me,
that's what a Hokage ought to be.</b></font>

161
00:20:00,940 --> 00:20:03,150
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's not even
close enough to kill me.</b></font>

162
00:20:03,690 --> 00:20:06,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I told you!
I'm not trying to kill you!</b></font>

163
00:20:07,730 --> 00:20:08,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm—!</b></font>

164
00:20:08,820 --> 00:20:09,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Enough.</b></font>

165
00:20:46,440 --> 00:20:49,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm the strongest in
this world right now.</b></font>

166
00:20:50,280 --> 00:20:51,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>So right now, right here…</b></font>

167
00:20:52,030 --> 00:20:55,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>will be my first step
into the shadows.</b></font>

168
00:22:42,190 --> 00:22:43,190
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I can feel it,

</b></font>

169
00:22:43,280 --> 00:22:45,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>how did he gain so much
Nature Energy so suddenly?

</b></font>

170
00:22:46,230 --> 00:22:48,190
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You finally decided to kill me, huh?

</b></font>

171
00:22:48,570 --> 00:22:50,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>We've taken on
a lot of responsibilities

</b></font>

172
00:22:50,440 --> 00:22:51,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>upon our shoulders…

</b></font>

173
00:22:52,230 --> 00:22:55,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But you see, I wanna fight,

</b></font>

174
00:22:55,480 --> 00:22:57,690
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and win against you
fair and square!

</b></font>

175
00:22:58,570 --> 00:23:02,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Next time on Naruto Shippuden:
Naruto and Sasuke


</b></font>

176
00:23:02,780 --> 00:23:05,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>…but not against the current you!


</b></font>

177
00:23:05,530 --> 00:23:08,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>NARUTO AND SASUKE


</b></font>

178
00:23:08,820 --> 00:23:28,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Tune in again!

</b></font>

